|*===----------------------------------------------------------------------===*|
|*                                                                            *|
|* This file enumerates the targets with an instruction simulator in this     *|
|* build of LLVM. Clients of this file should define the LLVM_TARGETSIM macro *|
|* to be a function-like macro with a single parameter (the name of the       *|
|* target); including this file will then enumerate all of those targets.     *|
|*                                                                            *|
|* The set of targets supported by LLVM is generated at configuration         *|
|* time, at which point this header is generated. Do not modify this          *|
|* header directly.                                                           *|
|*                                                                            *|
\*===----------------------------------------------------------------------===*/

#ifndef LLVM_TARGETSIM
#  error Please define the macro LLVM_TARGETSIM(TargetName)
#endif

@LLVM_ENUM_TARGETSIMS@

#undef LLVM_TARGETSIM
